  "summary": "Hi, I'm Kalyn! I'm an eLearning Developer with a passion for creating engaging, interactive, and user-centered learning experiences. I enjoy bringing together technology, design, and education to transform complex information into accessible and meaningful learning experiences. \n\nIn my current role at Boise State University, I collaborate with subject matter experts and clients to design and develop online courses and learning materials. My work included developing interactive courses using Articulate Storyline and Rise 360, creating instructional videos with Camtasia, and building learning resources within Canvas LMS. I particularly enjoy developing custom interaction that encourage learner engagement.\n\nMy background combines instructional design, educational technology, game design, and user experience. My educational background includes a Master's in Educational Technology with an emphasis in Educational Game Design, and a Bachelor's in Games. Interactive Media and Mobile Technologies. This combination has given me an appreciation for how thoughtful design, interactivity, and technology can improve a user's learning experience. \n\nI'm always interested in exploring new tools, techniques, and approaches to digital learning and finding creative ways to make learning more effective, accessible, and engaging.",
